Hi -

I've released fwknop-1.8.  This is a major release that adds the ability
to run the fwknop client on Windows systems from Cygwin, so you can now
authenticate to iptables/fwknopd from Windows.  Also, although this is
of less interest to people on this list, fwknop now supports ipfw
firewalls on *BSD systems as well.

